A todo list in the user's own words, asked about again in a new session.
It must still be there the next day. Before MEMPLAN phase 4 (one task list,
kept in mem) the model put it in the session-only todos tool, and the next
session said the list was empty.

-- prompt --
Make me a todo list for setting up CI here: add a GitHub Actions workflow, cache Go modules, and run the tests on pull requests. Don't do them yet, just the list.
-- prompt-new --
What's left on my todo list?
-- check --
answer last contains workflow
answer last contains cache
answer last contains pull request
